<</Title<FEFF00460065006C00690070006500200053006F00740069006C006C0065002020140020004400650076005300650063004F0070007300200041007200630068006900740065006300740020002600200045006E00670069006E006500650072>/Subject(DevSecOps architect and hands-on engineer for regulated, high-availability platforms (SWIFT, Swissquote). I design the release-orchestration and security standards that squads ship through, then coach 5+ squads until the standard holds: golden-path pipelines, SBOM, policy-as-code and DORA-aligned controls. I still ship code (Java tooling at SWIFT); before that, Java 21 and Spring at Swissquote, Vert.x and Kafka at scale. I govern coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Devin) with the same gates as human-written code.)/Keywords<>/Author(Felipe Sotille)/Creator(Typst 0.15.0)/ModDate(D:20261008195429Z)/CreationDate(D:20261008195429Z)>>
endobj
